title: 'HRMP: hold the relay chain channel deposits on a parachain'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Implements the two pallets that let the relay chain `hrmp` pallet keep its channel deposits on
    another chain.

    `pallet-hrmp-relay` runs on the relay chain and forwards request and answer between polkadot
    hrmp on the relay and `pallet-hrmp-para` on a parachain.

    `pallet-hrmp-para` runs on a parachain and holds the deposits.

crates:
- name: pallet-hrmp-relay
  bump: major
- name: pallet-hrmp-para
  bump: major
- name: hrmp-primitives
  bump: major
- name: polkadot-runtime-parachains
  bump: major
- name: polkadot-parachain-primitives
  bump: minor
- name: polkadot-runtime-common
  bump: patch
- name: polkadot-sdk-frame
  bump: none
